<title>JAPAN: Rohm shares fall on profit-taking.</title>
<headline>Rohm shares fall on profit-taking.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Rohm Co Ltd fell on Monday morning due to profit-taking emerging after a recent rapid rise, traders said.</p>
<p>At 0055 GMT, the semiconductor-related firm's shares were down 300 yen at 11,800. Turnover was 42,000 shares.</p>
